  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 55,
    "dress": "civvies",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 518
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まり",
    "text": "転校生くんのお母さんかぁ、きっと転校生くんによく似た美人さんなんだろうねぇ……♪　ご挨拶ぐらい、しときたかったけど"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 55,
    "dress": "civvies",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": null,
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 518
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まり",
    "text": "んん。そっか、お母さんは急に仕事が入ってお車で帰っちゃったんだねぇ。それはまぁ、休日なのにご苦労さんだねぇ？"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 55,
    "dress": "civvies",
    "pose": "2",
    "expression": "civvies_expression/sad1",
